      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you introduce a `transparent` wrapper around `libfdt_bindgen::fdt_property` providing methods abstracting away the endianness conversion (similar to `Fdt::totalsize()`)? This would allow you to clearly express `FdtProperty::fdt_property` as the `as_ref` of a `impl AsRef\u003cFdtPropertyStruct\u003e for FdtProperty` (where you\u0027d build the `FdtError` and `unwrap` as the property should always be valid).",
